{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Doppel",
    "steam_appid": 3711330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looming &quot;yourself&quot;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/f08bc77dd93f9a5d91452946cba0f7cb.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Doppel&quot; is a classic side-scrolling action game \u2014 but unlike most, it features <strong>only a single enemy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That enemy, Doppel, looks exactly like you and relentlessly chases you by perfectly mirroring your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you remain in the light, Doppel will pursue you without end. But in the darkness, you are safe \u2014 the shadows will shield you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/5c219ce3c8430a3093476e8c35b12522.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Facing Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/a7a00239441fb5c058a1cce5ff8d1bd8.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doppel is the embodiment of fear, born from your own mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While hiding in the dark may offer temporary relief, you must ultimately outpace and overcome Doppel in order to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a novelist standing at the edge of despair, must confront your roots and face the fears buried deep within your heart as you flee from Doppel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art: Minimal Pixel Graphics Using Only Two Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/345ee6ef05f1ae479446ef5ea694bfde.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every visual element in &quot;The Doppel&quot; is rendered <strong>using only two colors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This minimalistic, low-resolution style evokes a sense of nostalgia and invites the player\u2019s imagination to fill in the world\u2019s details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looming &quot;yourself&quot;<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/f08bc77dd93f9a5d91452946cba0f7cb.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=225 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Doppel&quot; is a classic side-scrolling action game \u2014 but unlike most, it features <strong>only a single enemy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That enemy, Doppel, looks exactly like you and relentlessly chases you by perfectly mirroring your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you remain in the light, Doppel will pursue you without end. But in the darkness, you are safe \u2014 the shadows will shield you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/5c219ce3c8430a3093476e8c35b12522.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Facing Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/a7a00239441fb5c058a1cce5ff8d1bd8.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doppel is the embodiment of fear, born from your own mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While hiding in the dark may offer temporary relief, you must ultimately outpace and overcome Doppel in order to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, a novelist standing at the edge of despair, must confront your roots and face the fears buried deep within your heart as you flee from Doppel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art: Minimal Pixel Graphics Using Only Two Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711330/extras/345ee6ef05f1ae479446ef5ea694bfde.avif?t=1754807431\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every visual element in &quot;The Doppel&quot; is rendered <strong>using only two colors</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This minimalistic, low-resolution style evokes a sense of nostalgia and invites the player\u2019s imagination to fill in the world\u2019s details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Doppel is a single player 2D action game.The player controls the protagonist, a failed novelist, and tries to recover his lost precious feelings while running away from the 'doppel' that pursues him in the dream world.",
